{"results":[{"url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2020/10/14/another-clunker-john-cornyns-ad-pre-existing-conditions/","final_url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2020/10/14/another-clunker-john-cornyns-ad-pre-existing-conditions/","title":"Analysis | Another clunker: John Cornyn’s ad on preexisting conditions","description":"Despite what the senator from Texas claims, Cornyn's proposal would expose sick patients to higher insurance costs, experts told us.","language":"en","text":"Democracy Dies in Darkness\n\nAnalysis by  Salvador Rizzo\n\n*“You know, preexisting conditions is something we all agree should be covered.”*\n\n**— Sen. John Cornyn (R-Tex.),** **in a campaign ad****, Oct. 8, 2020**\n\n---","author":"Salvador Rizzo","published_date":"2020-10-14T18:25:14.259Z","latency_ms":855.3891879855655,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}